      <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.8rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Anonymous = no login. Country detected via Cloudflare. Flagged rows = country in watch list ({{#each flaggedCountries}}{{this}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}}).</p>
